{%- comment -%}
  One grid item in sections/character-grid.liquid. Sibling of
  snippets/product-card-grid-item.liquid, but a <div> (not <li>) so it can
  sit next to the <div data-ap-cut-group> cluster headings that
  assets/ap-character-cuts.js injects when a cut is active — a <div> sibling
  inside a <ul> would be invalid list content.

  Params: product, index (1-based, across both available/sold-out passes),
  section, skip_styles, line (pre-joined string for data-line; blank when
  the product carries no alterpop.line value).

  data-height / data-year are intentionally never rendered — see
  character-grid.liquid's header comment. assets/ap-character-cuts.js reads
  their absence as "no live data" and disables those two chips on its own.
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="grid__item" data-line="{{ line | escape }}">
  {% render 'product-card',
    card_product: product,
    section_id: section.id,
    lazy_load: index > 2,
    skip_styles: skip_styles,
    hide_franchise: true,
    show_tier: true,
    product_view_context: 'collection'
  %}
</div>
